    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead &amp; Broken is a single-player medieval first-person shooter where you must face monster orders to save your life while making a name for yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be careful, you only have one life and you will have to keep it as long as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To make a name for yourself in this world, you must fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a mercenary who is thirsty for revenge and combat to sharpen his elemental magic skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your home village has been attacked by monsters and you must kill them all to get revenge and start your adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But before that, you must survive monster orders that spread across the continent and overseas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently there is only one playable map.</p>",
